sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Sim as Simulation / Perception
    participant Mem as Belief Graph
    participant LLM as Hypothesis Generator
    participant DM as Multimodal Decision Model
    participant Nav as Local Executor
    User->>LLM: Find room 501
    Sim->>Mem: room 112 visible, elevator sign partially visible
    Mem->>LLM: floor = unknown; H1: leading digit indicates floor; H2: indicates wing
    LLM->>DM: Candidate: look at sign, inspect door, explore branch, go to lift
    DM-->>Nav: Inspect directory: best feasible expected search cost
    Nav-->>User: Turn slightly left / approach safely
    Sim->>Mem: Directory confirms 500-range on floor 6
    Mem->>Mem: Reject floor-5 inference, retain original room-112 evidence
    Mem->>LLM: Corrected world state and progress outcome
    LLM->>Nav: Navigate toward validated floor-6 elevator connection
    Sim->>Mem: Door label 501 associated with physical door
    Mem-->>User: Destination verified (or request confirmation)
